## Parser Cause: 414 Reports

The date parser reads all dates as MM/DD (month first) regardless of user's browser locale setting. For day-first locales, tenants write DD/MM, causing day/month swaps.

**Affected:** All non-US locales and en-US edge cases
- en-GB: 91 reports
- en-US: 42 reports  
- pl-PL: 38 reports
- it-IT: 37 reports
- nl-NL: 36 reports
- fr-FR: 32 reports
- pt-PT: 27 reports
- cs-CZ: 27 reports
- da-DK: 27 reports
- es-ES: 24 reports
- de-DE: 23 reports
- en-IE: 23 reports

**Root Cause:** Parser does not respect browser locale for date format.

**GitHub Issue:** https://github.com/piotrczarnak/mega/issues/71
